  "safety_eula1Title": "1. Accepting these terms",
  "safety_eula1Body": "By creating an account or using Ourney you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the app.",
  "safety_eula2Title": "2. Zero tolerance for objectionable content",
  "safety_eula2Body": "Ourney does not tolerate objectionable content or abusive users of any kind. You may not post or send: nudity or sexual content; harassment, bullying or threats; hate speech or discrimination; violence; content that encourages self-harm; spam or scams; anything illegal or that infringes the rights of others.",
  "safety_eula3Title": "3. Your content",
  "safety_eula3Body": "Photos, captions and numbers you post stay yours. You allow Ourney to store them and show them to the people you choose to share with (group members, people with your public link). You are responsible for what you post.",
  "safety_eula4Title": "4. Reporting, blocking and moderation",
  "safety_eula4Body": "You can report check-ins or users and block anyone. We review reports within 24 hours, remove content that breaks these terms and remove the accounts of users who post it.",
  "safety_eula5Title": "5. Termination",
  "safety_eula5Body": "We may suspend or delete accounts that break these terms without notice. You can delete your account at any time from your Profile.",
  "safety_eula6Title": "6. Disclaimer and changes",
  "safety_eula6Body": "Ourney is provided \"as is\" and is not a substitute for professional medical, nutrition or fitness advice. When these terms change we'll let you know in the app.",

  "safety_privacy1Title": "What we store",
  "safety_privacy1Body": "Your email (to sign in); display name, username and avatar; the journeys you create; check-ins with their photo, caption, numbers (for example weight) and time taken; reactions; your reports and block list.",
  "safety_privacy2Title": "Who can see it",
  "safety_privacy2Body": "Private journeys are visible only to you. Group journeys are visible only to group members. A public link shows only what you turn on, and you can hide numbers or blur photos. In on-device mode your data never leaves your phone.",
  "safety_privacy3Title": "What we don't do",
  "safety_privacy3Body": "We don't sell your data. No ads. Your photos are not used for anything other than showing them in Ourney.",
  "safety_privacy4Title": "Notifications",
  "safety_privacy4Body": "Check-in reminders are local notifications, scheduled on your device.",
  "safety_privacy5Title": "Deleting your data",
  "safety_privacy5Body": "Go to Profile > Delete account to permanently delete your account and all your check-ins and photos from our servers. If you own a group, ownership passes to the earliest-joined member.",
  "safety_privacy6Title": "Contact",
  "safety_privacy6Body": "Questions about privacy? See the Contact page under Safety & support."
